{
  "$comment": "What --self-test requires inside a build (technical specification §8.5). Every entry must be present: a missing one is a failure, never a skip. qml_modules is what pyside6-qmlimportscanner finds in ui/qml (tests/unit/test_self_test.py keeps them in step). files are relative to the package; min is the least number of matches a glob must have.",
